62,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"@Victoria, A is an interior conversion. My weather data only hits exposed work. A avoids the rain risk, so the calendar holds. I support A.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Kenji,,"@Benjamin, A is interior, so it dodges the weather. But my tender data shows mechanical plant costs jumped twenty percent. Does A need heavy ducting?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
